{
  "id": "6aa1a54987588c5f7f654103",
  "title": "ランナーズ・エクリプス",
  "created": 1788978553,
  "updated": 1788979902,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6aa1a54987588c5f7f654103",
      "text": "ランナーズ・エクリプス",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788978553,
      "updated": 1788978553
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1a576000000000032b2c2",
      "text": "[https://abarayagames.com/runner/]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788978553,
      "updated": 1788978556
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1a577000000000032b2c3",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788978553,
      "updated": 1788978553
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1a57c000000000032b2c4",
      "text": " Windows用SLG",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788978558,
      "updated": 1788978578
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1a686000000000032b2c9",
      "text": "  自分のAIを[プログラミング]して相手に勝つゲーム",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788978825,
      "updated": 1788979902
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1a59d000000000032b2c7",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788978591,
      "updated": 1788979313
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1a6ab000000000032b2ca",
      "text": "  [https://gyazo.com/476716ef1975b82857a40708121e6f2a]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788978861,
      "updated": 1788978866
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1a875000000000032b2d5",
      "text": " 画面には自分(攻撃側)と相手(防御側)のステータス/プログラムが表示される",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788979319,
      "updated": 1788979319
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1a67f000000000032b2c8",
      "text": " プレイヤーは条件xアクションの組を最大6つまで組み合わせてプログラムを作成する",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788978818,
      "updated": 1788979317
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1a70e000000000032b2cc",
      "text": "  プログラムに適するようにステータスを振り直すことも可能",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788978961,
      "updated": 1788979440
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1a8d2000000000032b2da",
      "text": " 戦闘は事前に決めたプログラムに従って全自動で進行する",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788979413,
      "updated": 1788979472
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1a733000000000032b2cd",
      "text": "  相手のHPを0にするかFATALゲージを3まで貯めさせれば勝ち",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788978997,
      "updated": 1788979485
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1a57e000000000032b2c5",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788978561,
      "updated": 1788978561
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1a7d4000000000032b2d0",
      "text": " かなり特異なゲーム性",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788979159,
      "updated": 1788979242
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1a7e5000000000032b2d1",
      "text": "  相手の手の内が見えた状態でゲームが進行する",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788979176,
      "updated": 1788979221
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1a804000000000032b2d2",
      "text": "  彼我は非対称である",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788979206,
      "updated": 1788979271
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1a846000000000032b2d3",
      "text": "   行動順位が防衛側優先である他",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788979272,
      "updated": 1788979329
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1a87f000000000032b2d6",
      "text": "   防衛側は「負けなければいい」",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788979330,
      "updated": 1788979497
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1a8a5000000000032b2d8",
      "text": "    相手を倒す必要がない",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788979367,
      "updated": 1788979504
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1a8b6000000000032b2d9",
      "text": "    攻撃側は相手を倒す必要がある",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788979385,
      "updated": 1788979394
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1a9f7000000000032b2dd",
      "text": "  ランダム要素が存在しない",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788979706,
      "updated": 1788979712
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1a75e000000000032b2ce",
      "text": "  [カルネージハート]を別の切り口でカルネージにしたようなゲーム",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788979041,
      "updated": 1788979403
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1a75f000000000032b2cf",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788979041,
      "updated": 1788979041
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1a931000000000032b2dc",
      "text": "　アリーナという自分が作ったICE(プログラム)を防衛側として登録して",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788979508,
      "updated": 1788979758
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1aa2c000000000032b2df",
      "text": "　 全世界の人と戦える機能があるのだが",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788979758,
      "updated": 1788979793
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1aa4e000000000032b2e0",
      "text": "　 ガチ勢のICEは未だに勝てる気がしない[h45te.icon]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788979793,
      "updated": 1788979814
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1aa08000000000032b2de",
      "text": " シナリオBという拡張版があるらしい",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788979723,
      "updated": 1788979851
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa1aa6e000000000032b2e1",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1788979825,
      "updated": 1788979825
    }
  ]
}